{"ticker":"FTV","updated":"2026-11-27T22:55:17Z","profile":{"longName":"Fortive Corporation","shortName":"Fortive Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fortive.com","fullTimeEmployees":10000,"marketCap":19653462016,"trailingPE":31.29384,"forwardPE":19.818474,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.4705567,"pegRatio":1.46,"targetMeanPrice":67.64286,"targetHighPrice":75.0,"targetLowPrice":55.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.078,"earningsGrowth":2.475,"grossMargins":0.63471,"operatingMargins":0.19639999,"profitMargins":0.14829001,"totalRevenue":4396199936,"beta":0.942,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":68.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":52.43,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.42},"summary":"Fortive Corporation designs, develops, manufactures, and markets products, software, and services in the United States, China, and internationally. It operates through Intelligent Operating Solutions and Advanced Healthcare Solutions segments. The Intelligent Operating Solutions segment provides advanced instrumentation, software, and services, including maintenance, repair, measurement and condition monitoring, facility and asset lifecycle software applications, and connected worker safety and compliance solutions for manufacturing, process industries, healthcare, utilities and power, communications and electronics, and other industries. This segment markets its products and services under the ACCRUENT, FLUKE, GORDIAN, INDUSTRIAL SCIENTIFIC, INTELEX, and SERVICECHANNEL brand names. The Advanced Healthcare Solutions segment provides critical workflow solutions comprising instrument sterilization, instrument tracking, biomedical test tools, radiation detection and safety monitoring, and end-to-end clinical productivity software and solutions under the ASP, CENSIS, FLUKE BIOMEDICAL, LANDAUER, and PROVATION brand names. Fortive Corporation was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Everett, Washington.","summary_zh":"Fortive Corporation 在美國、中國和國際上設計、開發、製造和銷售產品、軟體和服務。它透過智慧運營解決方案和高級醫療解決方案部門運作。智慧操作解決方案部門提供先進的儀器儀表、軟體和服務，包括維護、維修、測量和狀態監測、設施和資產生命週期軟體應用程序，以及面向製造、流程工業、醫療保健、公用事業和電力、通訊和電子以及其他行業的互聯工人安全和合規解決方案。該部門以 ACCRUENT、FLUKE、GORDIAN、INDUSTRIAL SCIENTIFIC、INTELEX 和 SERVICECHANNEL 品牌銷售其產品和服務。高級醫療保健解決方案部門提供關鍵的工作流程解決方案，包括儀器滅菌、儀器追蹤、生物醫學測試工具、輻射檢測和安全監測以及端到端臨床生產力軟體和解決方案，品牌名稱包括 ASP、CENSIS、FLUKE BIOMEDICAL、LANDAUER 和 PROVATION。 Fortive Corporation 成立於 2015 年，總部位於華盛頓州埃弗里特。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"科學技術儀器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":48.78,"h":49.26,"l":48.545,"c":48.91,"v":3322600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":48.81,"h":49.01,"l":48.175,"c":48.99,"v":3202600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":48.9,"h":50.22,"l":48.69,"c":50.08,"v":4234600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":50.08,"h":50.79,"l":49.55,"c":49.78,"v":3007700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":49.82,"h":50.715,"l":49.795,"c":50.41,"v":3436000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":50.59,"h":50.84,"l":50.02,"c":50.03,"v":2622300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":50.25,"h":50.29,"l":49.31,"c":49.61,"v":1829100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":49.91,"h":50.15,"l":49.322,"c":49.84,"v":1852400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":50.02,"h":50.02,"l":49.16,"c":49.3,"v":1958000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":49.51,"h":49.64,"l":47.71,"c":47.8,"v":2453300},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":48.24,"h":48.86,"l":48.03,"c":48.58,"v":1888500},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":47.95,"h":49.31,"l":47.95,"c":49.03,"v":1375400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":48.44,"h":49.55,"l":48.1,"c":48.49,"v":3537500},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":48.89,"h":48.94,"l":48.28,"c":48.69,"v":1810000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":48.39,"h":48.86,"l":48.29,"c":48.66,"v":1797000},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":48.97,"h":49.5,"l":48.77,"c":49.28,"v":1504200},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":49.17,"h":50.16,"l":49.105,"c":49.78,"v":1503500},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":49.74,"h":49.94,"l":48.995,"c":49.08,"v":1966700},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":49.18,"h":49.75,"l":48.88,"c":49.62,"v":1467700},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":49.98,"h":50.05,"l":49.16,"c":49.47,"v":1679300},{